@startuml
actor Manager
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "REST API" as API
participant "Auth/RBAC" as Auth
participant "Inventory Service" as Inv
database DB
Manager -> UI: Confirm deletion
UI -> API: DELETE /api/inventory/{id}
API -> Auth: Validate token + role
Auth --> API: ADMIN/MANAGER
API -> Inv: Delete component
Inv -> DB: Mark inactive
Inv -> DB: Insert audit log
DB --> Inv: Commit
Inv --> API: Deleted
API --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> Manager: Refresh inventory
@enduml
